rd  but but look I I believe he was not  trying to impact the outcome of the  election I think he was trying to  protect his own reputation do you think  it did impact the election look there  were a lot of things that did and I  suspect it had some impact but I walked  back into my Senate office five days  after I introduced Hillary here in New  York for her concession speech and when  I crossed the mantle into my office I  realized this job just got much more  important that was before the election  and so I'm focused on things like Syria  trying to rein in an executive that once  the wage war you know without Congress  that's what I'm focused on all right  senator Cain thanks so much for being  with us thanks much
 

